From 10d2c036d6c322dee961057863b52303d8d995d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felix Krueckel <hi@felkru.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 16:16:55 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 16/52] One AI settings page and a short sidebar in embedded
 builds

The AI page holds the OpenRouter provider, # command search, suggestions
and third-party CLI agents. Planned features render greyed out with a
"Not implemented yet" tooltip. The sidebar keeps AI, Appearance,
Features, Keybindings, Warpify, Scripting, Privacy and About.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
